Z||000000||2M4 Dale||10-31-1999||01:15 AM||||I'm about to install a spoiler on my 87 coupe. Is there a difference between the springs on a non-spoiler lid to a spoiler lid? The spoiler will add weight. Also any suggestions on drilling the holes for the spoiler...||||reg||5
